WEBVTT

P1-1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600 line:88% position:50% align:center
Your people and agents see different truths.

P1-2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.420 line:88% position:50% align:center
The truth is scattered across the systems where work happens.

P1-3
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.310 line:88% position:50% align:center
People rebuild it by hand.

P1-4
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:12.980 line:88% position:50% align:center
Agents start without it.

P2-5
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.020 line:88% position:50% align:center
Navis turns those signals into one shared understanding.

P2-6
00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.282 line:88% position:50% align:center
Every email, meeting,

P2-7
00:00:21.322 --> 00:00:23.640 line:88% position:50% align:center
document and message becomes a signal —

P2-8
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.820 line:88% position:50% align:center
remembered, connected,

P2-9
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.100 line:88% position:50% align:center
and turned into what should happen next.

P3-10
00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:31.590 line:88% position:50% align:center
Inside a company, the Navis App is for people.

P3-11
00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:33.850 line:88% position:50% align:center
It shows what changed —

P3-12
00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.630 line:88% position:50% align:center
and why it matters.

P3-13
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.980 line:88% position:50% align:center
Every fact has its source,

P3-14
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.090 line:88% position:50% align:center
its time, and how fresh it is.

P3-15
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.330 line:88% position:50% align:center
When something needs a decision,

P3-16
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.340 line:88% position:50% align:center
Navis prepares the next step.

P3-17
00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:47.420 line:88% position:50% align:center
A person decides.

P3-18
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.050 line:88% position:50% align:center
Then the company acts.

P4-19
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.040 line:88% position:50% align:center
The same company's agents use Navis Developer.

P4-20
00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.270 line:88% position:50% align:center
Invite the team.

P4-21
00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:03.340 line:88% position:50% align:center
Connect once — through MCP, API, SDK or CLI.

P4-22
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.130 line:88% position:50% align:center
The agent asks —

P4-23
00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.720 line:88% position:50% align:center
and gets the company's context,

P4-24
00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:09.560 line:88% position:50% align:center
with sources and freshness.

P4-25
00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:12.080 line:88% position:50% align:center
Navis isn't the model.

P4-26
00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.810 line:88% position:50% align:center
It supplies the company's truth.

P4-27
00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.380 line:88% position:50% align:center
Every request is checked against its permissions.

P4-28
00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.020 line:88% position:50% align:center
The agent does the work,

P4-29
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.750 line:88% position:50% align:center
and the run is on record.

P5-30
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.740 line:88% position:50% align:center
A solo builder gets a private workspace.

P5-31
00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.200 line:88% position:50% align:center
A team can work together.

P5-32
00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:29.860 line:88% position:50% align:center
And the work state carries into the next session.

P5-33
00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:33.650 line:88% position:50% align:center
One company.

P5-34
00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:36.920 line:88% position:50% align:center
The person and the agent acted on the same event.

P6-35
00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.300 line:88% position:50% align:center
Same facts.

P6-36
00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:39.730 line:88% position:50% align:center
Same sources.

P6-37
00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.200 line:88% position:50% align:center
Same freshness.

P6-38
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.850 line:88% position:50% align:center
One understanding.

P6-39
00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:44.070 line:88% position:50% align:center
Two ways in.

P7-40
00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.030 line:88% position:50% align:center
Models change.

P7-41
00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:46.980 line:88% position:50% align:center
Agents change.

P7-42
00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:47.880 line:88% position:50% align:center
Tools change.

P7-43
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.030 line:88% position:50% align:center
What your company knows shouldn't have to start over.

P7-44
00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:54.650 line:88% position:50% align:center
Company-owned.

P7-45
00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:55.800 line:88% position:50% align:center
Model-neutral.

P7-46
00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.950 line:88% position:50% align:center
Shared by people and agents.

P8-47
00:01:58.800 --> 00:01:59.470 line:88% position:50% align:center
NavisLabs.

P8-48
00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.810 line:88% position:50% align:center
The shared understanding for your organization.

